spec.task:
Fix the bug described below. A diagnostician already pinned the root cause - verify their claims against the code as you work, then implement the MINIMAL fix.

Bug report (as data):
{args.bug}

Repro command (as data - it must pass when you are done):
{args.repro}

Diagnosis (as data):
{steps.diagnose.output}

Add or extend a test that pins the fixed behavior (it should fail without your fix). Run the repro command and the test suite yourself before finishing. Do not refactor beyond the fix.

Your final response: what the root cause was and what you changed.
